{"sourceUrl":"https://naoep.whut.edu.cn/zsjy/yjszs/202506/t20250620_1333939.shtml","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:58.599040+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://naoep.whut.edu.cn/zsjy/yjszs/202506/t20250620_1333939.shtml","html":"<div>\n<div><p><span><span><span>为进一步加强各高校优秀在校大学生对武汉理工大学</span></span><span><span>船海与能源动力工程学院</span></span><span><span>的了解，激发学生的科研热情，拓宽学生的学术视野，为有志于在武汉理工大学</span></span><span><span>船海与能源动力工程学院</span></span><span><span>深造的学生提供互动交流和学习的平台，现面向全国</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年应届本科毕业生举办全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>一、学院简介</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>船海与能源动力工程学院起源于</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1946</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年的国立武昌海事职业学校，是我国船舶与海洋工程领域科学研究和人才培养的重要基地。学院现有船舶与海洋工程、动力工程及工程热物理、流体力学、工程力学、结构工程</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>个学术学位博士学位点，机械、能源动力</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>个专业学位博士点，船舶与海洋工程、动力机械及工程、力学、结构工程、水利工程</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>个学术学位硕士点，机械、能源动力、土木水利</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>个专业硕士领域，并建有船舶与海洋工程、力学、动力工程</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>个博士后流动站。学院所设专业涉及船舶与海洋工程、动力工程及工程热物理、力学、土木工程、水利工程</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>个一级学科，其中船舶与海洋工程学科为一级学科国家重点学科、国防特色学科，</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2024</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年软科世界一流学科排名第</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>学院现有教授</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>51</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人，副教授</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>69</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人。国家青年拔尖人才</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人，享受国务院政府特殊津贴</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人，交通部青年科技英才</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人，湖北省“百人计划”</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人，湖北省青年拔尖人才</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人，楚天学者</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人，楚天学子</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人，中国科协青年人才托举工程</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人，武汉英才</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人，产学研特聘责任专家</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人，校一流专业责任教授</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人，校科技创新人才</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人，校青年拔尖人才第二层次</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>人。</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>79</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年来，学院累计培养</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>万余名专业人才，涌现出中国船级社原总裁莫鉴辉等大批优秀毕业生，一大批校友成为行业骨干，为我国船海与能源动力工程行业以及社会发展做出了应有贡献。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>具体招生专业如下：</span></span></span></span></p><center><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://naoep.whut.edu.cn/zsjy/yjszs/202506/W020250620601193677638.png\" title=\"\"/></p></center><p><br/></p><p><span><span><strong>二、夏令营具体安排</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>1.</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>申报时间</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>20</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>-23</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>2.</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>开营时间</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>-2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>3.</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>夏令营活动安排</strong></span></span></p><center><br/><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://naoep.whut.edu.cn/zsjy/yjszs/202506/W020250620601193673919.png\" title=\"\"/></p></center><p><span><span><span><span>注：本日程为拟定计划，具体安排可能会根据实际情况进行适当调整；营员报到后要求全程参加所有活动。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>4</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>、入营名单公示</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>我院将于学院官网公示入营名单。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>三、申请条件</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>全日制</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>届本科毕业生；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>诚实守信，身心健康，学风端正，无学业学术行为不端记录；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>学习成绩优秀，英语水平优秀，动手能力强，能达到所在高校推荐免试生要求；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>对所报专业领域的科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，有较强的科研潜力；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>在本科阶段具有个别突出的科研成果或专业特长者，予以优先考虑。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>四、申请程序</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>1</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>、网上报名</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>本届夏令营活动采取网上报名的方式。凡欲申请本次夏令营活动的各高校优秀学子，请于规定时间在武汉理工大学“夏令营报名系统”</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（网址为</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>http://whlg.form.360eol.com/enroll/325cJQM4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>）报名并上传资料。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>2</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>、申请资料</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>）本科成绩单（须加盖教务处或院系公章，</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>JPG</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>或</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>格式）与专业成绩排名证明。若院系不能出具排名证明，请提供说明；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>）有效居民身份证正反面和学生证（含照片、学号页）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>）个人陈述（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>800</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>字左右，无格式要求）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>）个人简历（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>A4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>一面，无格式要求）</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>）外语水平证明（英语四、六级考试成绩，托福</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>雅思成绩或</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>GRE/GMAT</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>成绩等）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>）其他体现自身学术水平的代表性论文、出版物或原创性工作成果（如有）：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span>①<span><span><span>已发表论文证明材料（论文应包括正文第一页（包含作者信息页，并在正文第一页右上角标注本人排名和影响因子））；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span>② <span><span><span>本科期间获奖证书或资格证书（校级及以上获奖，不超过</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>项）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>）申请人诚信承诺书；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>以上各文件请合并成一个</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>pdf</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>文件上传，扫描件要求清晰、工整，</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>pdf</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>文件以“姓名</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>本科院校</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>志愿专业”命名。</span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://naoep.whut.edu.cn/zsjy/yjszs/202506/t20250620_1333939.shtml\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><strong>五、其它说明</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、夏令营期间，我院为营员购买人身保险。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、本次夏令营不收取营员任何费用，入选营员交通与住宿自理，学院提供</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日午餐。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、最终被我院拟录取的异地高校学生（以</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>月份全国研究生推免系统录取结果为准），报销往返交通费（机票限经济舱、高铁或动车限二等座、火车限硬卧和硬座）（请务必留好票据等报销凭证</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>、未尽事宜，欢迎致电</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>027-86581133</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>（袁老师）咨询。</span></span></span></p><p><br/><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>船海与能源动力工程学院</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>20</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>\n<div>\n<span>附件下载：</span>\n</div>\n<div>\n\n<p>扫一扫在手机上查看当前页面</p>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"9e309764cde0192277eaf7241bc19429b904bf3def242c37dd24a22a8ae0ee50","textLength":1720,"sourceSha256":"fe491498054b27149b973a434ab20699aac113254ad42f566c09eecb559a9cc4","selector":"article-like:article_box content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b67f806e15113cb76e4d","title":"2025年武汉理工大学船海与能源动力工程学院2025年暑期优秀大学生夏令营通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:58.599040+00:00"}
